#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:528
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "The server and KRDC could not agree on a security protocol."
msgstr "服务器与 KRDC 无法就安全协议达成一致。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:531
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"Logging in to the gateway failed, or the server and KRDC could not agree on "
"a security protocol."
msgstr "登录网关失败，或服务器与 KRDC 无法就安全协议达成一致。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:535
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"NTLM is turned off for this host. Turn it on in the host settings unless the "
"domain controller can be reached."
msgstr ""
"此主机的 NTLM 已关闭。除非可以访问域控制器，否则请在主机设置中将其开启。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:538
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Set the TLS security level in the host settings to “Any”. The server may not "
"support the level selected."
msgstr ""
"请在主机设置中将 TLS 安全级别设为“任意”。服务器可能不支持之前选择的安全级别。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:542
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "The server requires Network Level Authentication (NLA)."
msgstr "服务器要求使用网络级身份验证 (NLA)。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:543
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Enable NLA in the security settings for this host."
msgstr "请在此主机的安全设置中启用网络级别身份验证 (NLA)。"

#: rdp/rdpview.cpp:561
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Check the RD Gateway settings for this host. The gateway “%1” may be "
"unreachable or reject the connection."
msgstr "请检查此主机的 RD 网关设置。网关“%1”可能无法访问或拒绝连接。"

