#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, dont_copy_passwords)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:244
#, kde-format
msgid "Don't copy passwords from supported password managers to remote hosts"
msgstr "不将密码复制到远程主机上 (需密码管理器支持)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, dont_copy_passwords)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:247
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Supported password managers (like KeePassXC) mark copied passwords with an "
"additional MIME type \"x-kde-passwordManagerHint\" which is used for "
"filtering."
msgstr ""
"支持的密码管理器会对已复制的密码标记上“x-kde-passwordManagerHint”的附加 MIME "
"类型，本功能会依此进行过滤。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, scrollMultiplierLabel)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:254
#, kde-format
msgid "Scroll &multiplier:"
msgstr "滚动倍增量(&M)："

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_ScrollMultiplier)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:264
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Number of scroll events sent to the remote desktop for each mouse wheel step."
msgstr "每个鼠标滚轮刻度向远程桌面发送的滚动事件数。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QSpinBox, kcfg_ScrollMultiplier)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:267
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Number of scroll events sent to the remote desktop for each mouse wheel "
"step. Increase this if scrolling is too slow, for example with macOS Screen "
"Sharing."
msgstr ""
"每个鼠标滚轮刻度向远程桌面发送的滚动事件数量。如果滚动太慢 (例如在 macOS 屏幕"
"共享中)，请增加此值。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, connectionLabel)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:311
#, kde-format
msgid "Connection &type:"
msgstr "连接类型(&T)："

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, kcfg_Quality)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:327
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use this to specify the performance of your connection. Note that you should "
"select the speed of the weakest link - even if you have a high speed "
"connection, it will not help you if the remote computer uses a slow modem. "
"Choosing a level of quality that is too high on a slow link will cause "
"slower response times. Choosing a lower quality will increase latencies in "
"high speed connections and results in lower image quality, especially in "
"'Low Quality' mode."
msgstr ""
"使用此选项指定连接的性能。请注意，您应当选择最差的连接速度 - 就算您有高速连"
"接，但如果对方使用慢的调制解调器，您的高速网络也起不到作用。在慢速连接上选择"
"太高的质量将导致响应时间变缓。选择较低质量将增加高速连接的等待时间并导致较低"
"的图像质量，特别是“低质量”模式。"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_Quality)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:331
#, kde-format
msgid "High Quality (LAN, direct connection)"
msgstr "高质量(局域网、直接连接)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_Quality)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:336
#, kde-format
msgid "Medium Quality (DSL, Cable, fast Internet)"
msgstr "中质量(DSL、有线电视网、快速 Internet)"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), item, widget (KComboBox, kcfg_Quality)
#: vnc/vncpreferences.ui:341
#, kde-format
msgid "Low Quality (Modem, ISDN, slow Internet)"
msgstr "低质量(调制解调器、ISDN、慢速 Internet)"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:267
#, kde-format
msgid "Access to the system requires a password."
msgstr "访问此系统需要密码。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:267
#, kde-format
msgid "Authentication failed. Please try again."
msgstr "认证失败，请再试一次。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:319
#, kde-format
msgid "VNC authentication failed because of too many authentication tries."
msgstr "VNC 认证失败，因为连接尝试次数过多。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Wait a few minutes. The server blocks logins for a while after several "
"failed attempts."
msgstr "请稍等几分钟。服务器在多次登录失败后会暂时阻止登录。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:323
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Then connect again and enter the password carefully."
msgstr "然后重新连接并小心输入密码。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:329
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The server requires an authentication method that KRDC does not support."
msgstr "服务器要求一种 KRDC 不支持的身份认证方式。"

#: vnc/vncview.cpp:331
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Configure the VNC server to use standard VNC password authentication, or "
"connect through an SSH tunnel."
msgstr "配置 VNC 服务器使用标准的 VNC 密码身份认证，或通过 SSH 隧道连接。"

